usage: verify_archive_reruns.py [-h] [--download] [--model {simplefold,nbb2}]
                                [--run-directory RUN_DIRECTORY]
                                [--report REPORT]
                                [--require-checkpoint-hashes]
                                [--require-exact]

Verify retained repeat coordinates and compare repeat scores with the
benchmark.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --download
  --model {simplefold,nbb2}
  --run-directory RUN_DIRECTORY
                        Completed local versioned run; never downloaded into
  --report REPORT       Separate local verification JSON; required with --run-
                        directory
  --require-checkpoint-hashes
                        Require complete hash logging for a newer run; omit
                        for NBB2 v1
  --require-exact       Require exact saved/replayed rows, beyond score-
                        rounding tolerance
